[[0,3488,0,3,0,3,"2014-05-07T14:48:00","Atko","",[],"<p>I started working on functionality which will allow anyone to register a subverse (whoaverse.com/v/yoursubversehere). This will take some time to develop but once it is done, subverse owners will be able to add moderators, delete or approve submissions etc.</p>\n<p>I plan to release this in small increments. The very first thing that will be implemented is registration of subverses. <strong>Let's see who gets to grab the best subverse names</strong> :)</p>","Registration of new subverses by users","","voatdev"],[1,3199,0,1,0,1,"2014-05-08T22:24:00","Atko","",[],"<p>Update:</p>\n<p>Underlying model is pretty much finished (although only 3 basic properties can be set for now: subverse name, subverse title and subverse sidebar text), but more will follow later.</p>\n<p>The views required to create a new subverse are also almost ready.</p>\n<p>Unless I get too tired of programming for today, subverse registrations could be launched in a few hours from now :)</p>"],[1,3200,0,1,0,1,"2014-05-09T01:50:00","Atko","",[],"<p>Aaaand done. Registrations are open :)</p>"],[1,3346,0,1,0,1,"2014-06-19T10:01:00","Unicorn","",[],"<p>How do I subscribe?</p>\n<p>The subscribe button is not clickable for some reason, anyone know how to subscribe?</p>"]]
